cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Multipole and Berezinskii-Kosterlitz-Thouless transitions in the two-component plasma: a Lean 4 formalization"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/jboursier/multipole-bkt-lean"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the main results of the paper
  "Multipole and Berezinskii-Kosterlitz-Thouless Transitions in the Two-component Plasma":
  the free energy expansion of the two-dimensional two-component plasma with smeared charges,
  in terms of dipole activities and the Mayer series, and the multipole distribution, with
  large deviations for the multipole counts and the typical number of multipoles, for every
  inverse temperature beta > 2. The development imports the formalization of the companion
  paper as TwoComponentCoulomb. The library contains no sorry and no custom axiom, and each
  of the seven formalized results has a Mathlib-only comparator challenge.
authors:
